00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:47.773
Like...

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:54.273
Like through, I'd say, 6th grade,

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:58.170
to, but I don't remember
none of my young...

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:01.570
Young life, really I don't.

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:02.703
