00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:25.460
I wasn't that smart.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:30.060
My mom, like, I was always
in and out of restaurants.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:33.370
My dad, he worked at a
restaurant, my stepdad.

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:36.060
