00:03:46.133 --> 00:03:49.900
- Yeah, no, then my dad, no, he wasn't.

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:53.150
And my grandmother, no, my
grandmother, my grandmother,

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:55.410
my grandmother and all those family, no,

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.740
they're not, they're ranchers out there.

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:01.730
How I met the Mexican Mafia
is because at 15 years old

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:05.690
I met my street dad, and
he was Mexican Mafia.

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:06.600
- [Mark] Oh, that's who
