00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:10.310
- Yeah, so my dad, he
was like into bullfights,

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:15.023
my other dad, and shit
like that, like real stuff.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.893
Now, I don't know,

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:22.320
but yeah, I don't know how this came...

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:25.740
- [Mark] You started
using drugs at what age?

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:28.238
