00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.570
- Nothing, whatever I
use, it doesn't matter.

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:55.263
Everybody else is out there.

00:04:55.263 --> 00:04:56.570
- [Mark] But you're using drugs today?

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:57.770
- Sometimes, yeah.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:00.280
- Yeah?
- Yeah, because I have to,

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:02.320
just to cope with all
the bullshit and the pain

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:05.200
and all kinds of stuff.
- What kind of pain?

00:05:09.912 --> 00:05:13.204
- I don't know, that
was downstairs talking.

00:05:13.204 --> 00:05:15.282
- [Mark] I'm sorry?

00:05:15.282 --> 00:05:17.632
- Did you know I met God
the other day, though?

00:05:25.195 --> 00:05:29.373
