go haywire in your life?

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:36.663
- When I met my husband.

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:42.570
- [Mark] And what kind of stuff happened?

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:43.403
- Mm.

00:05:45.452 --> 00:05:48.340
I've just been distracted
by his family since then.

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:51.780
I didn't know his family,
I didn't know nobody.

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.550
I didn't know any of them but a couple,

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:57.453
just a mother and father, a
father of his, his father.

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:00.280
Yeah, that's when my shit went haywire.

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:01.860
He had just thought that he was gonna

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:04.960
take on and put whatever
he did, I don't care.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:07.420
Whatever's real, I don't know.

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:09.893
But what I do is I fight for the people.

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:15.720
That's what I do, and I fought
for my people, number one.

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:19.800
What I heard is two years ago
they dropped them off a deck,

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:20.633
all of them.

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:23.720
I don't know if that's true.

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.420
I believe maybe it could've been.

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:30.293
I don't know, but I woke
them all up. (laughs)

00:06:31.998 --> 00:06:34.140
I woke all those sonuvabitches up,

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:35.730
told them to get up out of
their graves and they did,

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:37.500
and I said, how'd you get out?

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.240
Did you crawl, what did you do?

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:40.940
They said they dug themselves out.

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:44.280
How the hell did they dig
themselves out of a coffin

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:48.150
I'll never know, but that
gate must've unlocked

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:54.600
and something must have
pushed on top of their coffin,

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:56.723
you know what I'm saying, and sure,

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:59.860
somebody had to help them up out of there,

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:01.800
but they got out of there,
and I don't know how,

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:04.520
