that I've woken up.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.740
- [Mark] Ruby, what was your
best memory in your life?

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:13.953
- Mm.

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:18.360
My grandma.

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:22.293
My grandma and my mom,

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:27.240
