00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:15.810
- No, because they have all
these places around here.

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:16.660
- Yeah, the free food.
- Yeah.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:19.250
So I don't ever go without food.

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:21.480
Now if I want to eat the food, maybe not.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:22.313
- [Mark] Yeah.

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:25.310
- I don't trust shit out there,
you know what I'm saying?

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:29.190
I really don't, but I
have to trust something,

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:32.750
you know what I'm saying, and
I do, and I trust whatever.

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:35.373
But like yeah, I have
hope, I have a lot of hope.

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:43.793
You read that one and I'll give
you one other book to read.

00:08:43.793 --> 00:08:47.750
I've got so many of them
I don't know what to do.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:50.030
Okay, this book, this is the big one.

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:53.520
Is that the big, no.
- You always bring me gifts.

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:56.350
