00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:58.500
I like you a lot, whenever I
didn't see you for a while,

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:01.636
I kind of get scared.
- I go into town sometimes.

00:09:01.636 --> 00:09:03.880
- I get a little uneasy,

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:06.290
