00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:47.140
- [Mark] Thank you for
the books and stuff.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:50.000
- Yeah yeah yeah. Ooh, sorry.
- That's okay.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:51.083
- Yeah, so that's it.

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:55.330
