00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.200
intentionally mean to blow
my friend up over there,

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:10.453
but he came right back,
thank god, but still.

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:14.270
I just turned around and I
walked away and I didn't...

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:16.270
