00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:20.293
I don't know, but some shit set off.

00:10:20.293 --> 00:10:22.540
- [Mark] When's the last
time you saw your family?

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:24.640
Kids or anybody.
- A long time.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:26.923
Like three years, 2 1/2 years.

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:30.820
- [Mark] They probably know
