00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:16.220
No, was it...

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:21.079
It was North Hollywood, yeah, it was.

00:11:21.079 --> 00:11:21.950
- [Mark] I don't think so.

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:25.460
- [Ruby] Yeah, that's where
I have seen you before,

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:27.909
