00:11:27.909 --> 00:11:28.742
- [Mark] I don't really
get up there very often.

00:11:28.742 --> 00:11:30.700
- [Ruby] Okay, but you never did surgery?

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:32.690
- Never.
- Doctor.

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:34.830
- [Mark] I should've, but
I never did, never pursued.

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:36.400
- [Ruby] You got a brother that does it?

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:38.320
- [Mark] I got a sister
that kind of does it, yeah.

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:43.320
- [Ruby] Okay, no, no,
no, it had to be, well,

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:45.100
I know you're somewhere
up there with the doctor

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:48.015
or something like that.
- I'm just a photographer.

00:11:48.015 --> 00:11:49.260
- Well, you're beautiful at it.

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:50.140
- [Mark] You are too.

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:52.210
- And I love you for
everything you do for me.

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:53.990
- I love you too, Ruby.
- Yes, sir.

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:55.340
- [Mark] Every time I see you, I smile.

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:56.576
